  "id": "team",
  "term": "team",
  "definition": "In this context, a team is a group involved in coordinated specialty care for psychosis, including specialists, the person experiencing psychosis, and family members who work together in shared decision-making. It is part of a recovery-oriented approach designed to make care easier to access.",
